[{:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-71668"] :question/problem "Let $a=⟨1,-2,5⟩$ and $b=⟨3,-1,-1⟩.$ Find the vector projection of $a$ onto $b.$" :question/worked-solution "Using the formula for the vector projection, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{proj}}_{b}\\,a & =\\frac{a\\cdot b}{b\\cdot b}b \\\\  & =\\frac{{a}_{x}{b}_{x}+{a}_{y}{b}_{y}+{a}_{z}{b}_{z}}{{b}_{x}^{2}+{b}_{y}^{2}+{b}_{z}^{2}}b \\\\  & =\\frac{1\\cdot 3+(-2)\\cdot (-1)+5\\cdot (-1)}{{3}^{2}+(-1)^{2}+(-1)^{2}}b \\\\  & =\\frac{0}{{3}^{2}+(-1)^{2}+(-1)^{2}}b \\\\  & =⟨0,0,0⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-212457/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "c68016e9-9d30-5cec-9263-c17ef24425f2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-212457/selection/5d022a88a643e97abec4d01dfce48411101475c0705a98f29f3a8e3560fb0616" :answer/id #uuid "07f14e45-7c1c-57cc-8020-af14ff0dbea4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-10" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-212457/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "e14d5fd8-9999-5eb3-9e8f-c7bb912e137d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-212457/selection/4de395131b8c6206950603752bf3404c42f4dd6f0a41fee38e42388d1b92c133" :answer/id #uuid "d9664965-cd34-5e03-868b-06c5c27ad884" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-212457/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "77997707-519b-5964-881a-c168998ed4a0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-212457/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "1ade2e65-2f89-544d-87f3-d97153ad71a0" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-212457/selection/5d022a88a643e97abec4d01dfce48411101475c0705a98f29f3a8e3560fb0616" :answer-field/choices ["q-212457/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" "q-212457/selection/5d022a88a643e97abec4d01dfce48411101475c0705a98f29f3a8e3560fb0616" "q-212457/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" "q-212457/selection/4de395131b8c6206950603752bf3404c42f4dd6f0a41fee38e42388d1b92c133" "q-212457/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-212457" :question/id #uuid "7b29d332-37dc-57b2-92da-0a898b30100b" :question/math-academy-id "q-212457" :question/problem "Let $a=⟨0,1,-5⟩$ and $b=⟨6,x,-2⟩.$ Given that the projection of $a$ onto $b$ is the zero vector, find the value of $x.$" :question/worked-solution "Since $a$ is a nonzero vector, its projection onto another nonzero vector $b$ equals the zero vector only when the vectors are perpendicular. \n\nSo, we must have\n\n$$\na⊥b\\,⟹\\,a\\cdot b=0.\n$$\n\nComputing the dot product, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\cdot b & ={a}_{x}\\cdot {b}_{x}+{a}_{y}\\cdot {b}_{y}+{a}_{z}\\cdot {b}_{z} \\\\  & =0\\cdot 6+1\\cdot x+(-5)\\cdot (-2) \\\\  & =x+10.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSetting the dot product equal to $0,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\cdot b & =0 \\\\ x+10 & =0 \\\\ x & =-10.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-212457/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "84c96375-27d5-5ada-a952-34e09b3e92bf"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-212457"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-212461"] :question/problem "Let $a=[\\begin{aligned}-4 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]$ and $b=[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ -1 \\\\ x\\end{aligned}].$ Given that the projection of $a$ onto $b$ is the zero vector, find the value of $x.$" :question/worked-solution "Since $a$ is a nonzero vector, its projection onto another nonzero vector $b$ equals the zero vector only when the vectors are perpendicular. \n\nSo, we must have\n\n$$\na⊥b\\,⟹\\,a\\cdot b=0.\n$$\n\nComputing the dot product, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\cdot b & ={a}_{x}\\cdot {b}_{x}+{a}_{y}\\cdot {b}_{y}+{a}_{z}\\cdot {b}_{z} \\\\  & =-4\\cdot 4+4\\cdot (-1)+1\\cdot x \\\\  & =x-20.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSetting the dot product equal to $0,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\cdot b & =0 \\\\ x-20 & =0 \\\\ x & =20.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-317653/field-1/4582dbd6025ba0c110f8e23964efc62e8612751348ffad003e8834a5780c1878" :answer/id #uuid "64798b2a-88ef-52fb-937a-1a6f37afa616" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{4}{7}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-317653/field-1/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "a9fb9e77-1272-521f-83f7-d1e2092c5bb2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-317653/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "74ff6817-25d2-5d13-9dc5-9c1e38e63dcd" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-317653/field-1/4582dbd6025ba0c110f8e23964efc62e8612751348ffad003e8834a5780c1878" :answer-field/choices ["q-317653/field-1/4582dbd6025ba0c110f8e23964efc62e8612751348ffad003e8834a5780c1878" "q-317653/field-1/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-317653/field-2/774940da4ab3b26727b8db6c1c90fb931ece0a7759ec47b6581e5af495721ce1" :answer/id #uuid "24c9692f-4dfe-546c-ad9a-bc7b3baa7e42" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{2}{7}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-317653/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "7fee79fc-b270-5b42-a63b-4d3dbad8cd33" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-317653/field-2/774940da4ab3b26727b8db6c1c90fb931ece0a7759ec47b6581e5af495721ce1" :answer-field/choices ["q-317653/field-2/774940da4ab3b26727b8db6c1c90fb931ece0a7759ec47b6581e5af495721ce1"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-317653/field-3/d3a7133ef1a1f6526aaec763d522f5ae075d8386a4606de90dcb93094f1d21d6" :answer/id #uuid "8655fadd-43ca-5a92-910e-3688532bda93" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{7}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-317653/field-3" :answer-field/id #uuid "bf5752bf-ad94-54e4-a278-430d7498f42c" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-317653/field-3/d3a7133ef1a1f6526aaec763d522f5ae075d8386a4606de90dcb93094f1d21d6" :answer-field/choices ["q-317653/field-3/d3a7133ef1a1f6526aaec763d522f5ae075d8386a4606de90dcb93094f1d21d6"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-317653" :question/id #uuid "39d40898-be81-5d74-b4fd-980d9d4c6f07" :question/math-academy-id "q-317653" :question/problem "Let $c=⟨2,1,-3⟩$ and $d=⟨4,-2,1⟩.$ Find the vector projection of $c$ onto $d.$\n\n${\\text{proj}}_{d}\\,c=⟨$  \n{{field-1}}$,$\n{{field-2}}$,$\n{{field-3}}\n$⟩$" :question/worked-solution "Using the formula for the vector projection, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{proj}}_{d}\\,c & =\\frac{c\\cdot d}{d\\cdot d}\\,d \\\\  & =\\frac{{c}_{x}{d}_{x}+{c}_{y}{d}_{y}+{c}_{z}{d}_{z}}{{d}_{x}^{2}+{d}_{y}^{2}+{d}_{z}^{2}}\\,d \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\cdot 4+1\\cdot (-2)+(-3)\\cdot 1}{{4}^{2}+(-2)^{2}+{1}^{2}}\\,d \\\\  & =\\frac{8-2-3}{16+4+1}\\,⟨4,-2,1⟩ \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{21}\\,⟨4,-2,1⟩ \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{7}\\,⟨4,-2,1⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\,\\frac{4}{7},-\\frac{2}{7},\\frac{1}{7}\\,⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-317653/field-1" "q-317653/field-2" "q-317653/field-3"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "c0670172-77cb-5e88-b78d-e5136c06095f"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-317653"] :db/en